### Logout (invalidates this JWT until expiry)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get account by id (self or ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/auth/accounts/a1b0b56d-7693-4f75-b42d-1138cfa5f824
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

